      "kind": "hook",
      "start": 0.0,
      "end": 3.84,
      "text": "Consolidating expert language models can be slow and uneven."
    },
    {
      "kind": "beat",
      "start": 3.84,
      "end": 14.495,
      "text": "Multi-teacher on-policy distillation, MOPD, consolidates domain experts. But MOPD is a heavy pipeline and often doesn't recover all domains evenly.",
      "visual": { "type": "title", "title": "MOPD: Heavy & Uneven", "subtitle": "" },
      "shots": [
        { "at": "heavy", "show": "KeyPoint", "props": { "text": "Heavy pipeline" }, "t": 11.04 }
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "beat",
      "start": 14.495,
      "end": 27.15,
      "text": "P^2-MOPD accelerates this by treating a linear combination of student and expert parameters as one differentiable model. It jointly optimizes mixing coefficients and student weights.",
      "visual": { "type": "title", "title": "P^2-MOPD: Joint Optimization", "subtitle": "" },
      "shots": [
        {
          "at": "combination",
          "show": "KeyPoint",
          "props": { "text": "Linear parameter combination" },
          "t": 18.415
        },
        {
          "at": "optimizes",
          "show": "KeyPoint",
          "props": { "text": "Optimizes coefficients and weights" },
          "t": 24.735
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "beat",
      "start": 27.15,
      "end": 44.015,
      "text": "This method uses experts as parameter priors. For a 1.7B model, P^2-MOPD achieved 94.7% average recovery, surpassing MOPD's 80.9%. It also raised worst-domain recovery to nearly 90%.",
      "visual": { "type": "stat", "label": "Average Recovery", "value": "94.7%" },
